    "An MDBList key adds IMDb, Rotten Tomatoes, Metacritic and Letterboxd scores to every title. Without one, TMDB's score is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مفتاح ⁨MDBList⁩ يضيف تقييمات ⁨IMDb⁩ و⁨Rotten Tomatoes⁩ و⁨Metacritic⁩ و⁨Letterboxd⁩ لكل عمل. وبدونه يظهر تقييم ⁨TMDB⁩."
          }
        }
      }
    },
